Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 13:23:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Compliance v2: fail-closed enforcement, full path coverage,
 AI review

Enforcement
- resolveJobCompliance is fail-closed (ComplianceUnavailableError -> 503);
  text generation, video enqueue, Guided/spokesperson scripts, scheduling and
  publishing stop instead of running without rules.
- One gate (complianceGateError) for approval AND render; the runner checks
  at produceVideo start, renderApprovedClipStoryboard and topic resume.
- Acknowledgements and AI reviews are bound to a content fingerprint (all
  reviewed texts + pinned pack version + facts + negative terms).
- Rule packs are versioned and immutable (2026.10.1, 2026.10.2); jobs are
  checked with their pinned version; unknown version -> 409.

Coverage
- Directed text-to-video: inputs at enqueue, rules in the director prompt,
  compiled prompt checked before the provider call.
- Polished shot prompts checked before render; regulated clip storyboards
  forced into review.
- Spokesperson scripts (rules + report), lip-sync recordings (ASR
  transcript), typed lip-sync scripts, dubs.
- Posts: tenant-level text rules; schedule + all five publish cores gate
  (422 block / 503 transient); live check in the Library editor.
- Retry of failed regulated jobs re-reviewed; web ack on retry.
- Mobile: profession rules card, compliance badge on videos.

Checker
- AI second-pass review (semantic.ts): multilingual, fail-closed, findings
  validated against pack rules, locations and quoted text; feature switch
  complianceAiReview (default on).
- Pack 2026.10.2 adds Hindi/Telugu/Tamil and Hinglish patterns.

Tests: unit (pinning, fingerprints, Indic, AI parsing, posts), real-DB
integration (review->render journey, AI block/outage, unknown version,
retry, fail-closed lookups, cross-account isolation, schedule/publish),
web and mobile component tests.

